mmercial regression suites that run automatically before the Vercel production build.
+
+### Changed
+
+- The original keyless Esri World Imagery + Re:Earth terrain + OSM fallback stack remains the default globe instead of requiring Cesium ion.
+- Google Places, OpenAI, Cesium ion, NASA FIRMS and AIS are optional enhancements rather than application boot requirements.
+- Google rating/review constraints are never fabricated in FREE mode; Commercial Strength is used when licensed review data is unavailable.
+- Screenshot capture is best-effort so a Chromium/Gemini failure cannot kill deterministic website intelligence.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Fixed missing commercial test runner referenced by the WIP package.
+- Fixed strict TypeScript issues in market research, capture interception and Overture fetch options.
+- Fixed Google compatibility proxy response shapes for the original client.
+- Fixed client builds so they use the installed local Vite binary instead of an `npx` network fallback.
+- Fixed the Chromium runtime pack to use the deployment-hosted Vercel pattern and a valid architecture-specific upstream fallback.
+
 ## [0.1.1] — 2026-09-01 — Installation and live-data fixes
 
 ### Changed
